sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a SetDisplayMessageRequest with a Normal Cycle priority

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: message.id = <Generated Id><br>message.priority = <Configured Priority>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = Rejected)
